cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Uganda Climate Intelligence Framework (UCIF)"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible pipeline and manuscript behind "A National Climate Anomaly
  Intelligence System for Uganda: Ground-Truth Validation, Risk Nowcasting, and
  Long-Term Climate Change Assessment". Builds a ground-truth-honest benchmark
  of unsupervised anomaly
  detectors against a curated disaster register, adds century-scale in-situ
  trends, an independent NASA POWER gap-fill of the 1990-2007 observing collapse,
  derived SPI/SPEI drought indices, a cereal-yield impact linkage, the UCASI
  severity index and SHAP-based explainability. Every reported number is
  computed by the pipeline.
authors:
